      },
      "note": "The zero column can't lend directly, so the cascade has to reach past it to hundreds. The student mishandles the zero column — hundreds is never decremented, and tens becomes 9 (as if it had simply 'become 9') instead of correctly receiving +10 as part of the cascade."
    }
